Third-party code
None bundled. ZeroLeak has no runtime dependencies, loads no external scripts,
fonts or images, and uses only system fonts. When served from Vercel, the host
adds its own page-view analytics script at /_vercel/insights/script.js; that
script is not part of this project's source.
